  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Míeɖɔ ɖoɖo gbãtɔ aɖe ɖo: Belgium (BE) trɔ yi Dɔtsigbe fifia ɖe Fransegbe teƒe — Flemish gbeƒoawo woe nye dukɔa me tɔ akpa gãtɔ (~60%) wu Walloon Fransegbeƒoawo (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Míeɖɔ ɖoɖo gbãtɔ aɖe ɖo: Kazakhstan (KZ) trɔ yi Kazakhgbe fifia ɖe Rasiagbe teƒe, esi Kazakhgbe gɔmeɖeɖe li fifia — enye ɖɔɖɔ ma tɔgbi si míewɔ na Belgium tsã.",
