  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "Gbe blaeve le dɔ wɔm fifia: Eŋlisigbe, Hanyi Xexemetɔ, Hanyi Bɔbɔetɔ, Japangbe, Koreagbe, Fransegbe, Germaniagbe, Spaingbe, Portugalgbe, Rasiagbe, Arabgbe, Turkiagbe, Persiagbe, Bengaligbe, Hindigbe, Indonesiagbe, Vietnamgbe, Griisigbe, Italiagbe, Dɔtsigbe.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Laesens Dzidziɖoƒe Eve: dukɔmetɔwo katã ƒe faa dzidziɖoƒe kple asitsatsa dzidziɖoƒe si to kadodo me.",
  "UI": "UI",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Ʋuʋunyenye si womeɖo gɔme o la, AI dɔwɔɖoɖowo buna abe se ƒe kakaɖedzimanɔmee ene, eye woɖea wo ɖa; mɔɖeɖe si se le eŋu, si makina ate ŋu axlẽ koe wɔa nuŋlɔŋlɔ wòzua nu si woate ŋu asrɔ̃ le nyateƒe me.",
