  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Wɛb fɔntiwo tsona le Google Fonts si xɔa fɔnti biabia gɔmetɔwo tso wò browser gbɔ. Womezãa ame bubu ƒe skript aɖeke bubu o.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Nu si AI ɖoɖowo ate ŋu awɔ kple nuŋlɔŋlɔ: xexlẽ, nyaɖeɖekpui, tɔtrɔ, gbugbɔxɔxɔ, hehe, asitsatsa zazã, gakaka. AICR ƒe sewo kple AICL ƒe laesensnana akpaa na be woate ŋu aɖe gomekpɔkpɔ siawo gbeƒã eye woawɔ asitsatsa ɖe wo dzi.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Nu si server ate ŋu atrɔ ne AI tsatsala aɖe bia nuŋlɔŋlɔ si gbɔ laesens, ke laesens token mele esi o — asixɔxɔ si makina ate ŋu awɔ dɔ le, ɖe mɔ si tu keŋkeŋ teƒe.",
  "What this site is": "Nu Si Saet Sia Nye",
  "What this site is not": "Nu Si Saet Sia Menye O",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "Ɖe AI ate ŋu asrɔ̃ nu hã, va se ɖe gogloɖoƒe ka, na taɖodzinu kawo, kple le dɔdeasi kawo te. Be woaxlẽ nane menye be woasrɔ̃ nu tso eme o; \"womegbee o\" mefia \"woate ŋu asrɔ̃ nu tso eme\" o. AIRS kple AILP trɔa nusrɔ̃srɔ̃ mɔɖeɖe wòzua xexlẽɖoɖo si lolo ɖe edzi, si makina ate ŋu axlẽ.",
  "Whitepapers": "Numekuku-Agbalẽwo",
